### Step 3: Discretize the PDE

Using the Crank-Nicolson method, we approximate the PDE at time \( t^{n+1} \) and \( t^n \):

\[ \frac{u_i^{n+1} - u_i^n}{k} + \frac{1}{2} \left( u_i^{n+1} \frac{u_{i+1}^{n+1} - u_{i-1}^{n+1}}{2h} + u_i^n \frac{u_{i+1}^n - u_{i-1}^n}{2h} \right) = 0.01 \left( \frac{u_{i+1}^{n+1} - 2u_i^{n+1} + u_{i-1}^{n+1}}{2h^2} + \frac{u_{i+1}^n - 2u_i^n + u_{i-1}^n}{2h^2} \right) \]

