The Crank-Nicolson scheme for the PDE is:
\[ \frac{u_i^{n+1} - u_i^n}{k} = \frac{D}{2h^2} \left( (u_{i+1}^{n+1} - 2u_i^{n+1} + u_{i-1}^{n+1}) + (u_{i+1}^n - 2u_i^n + u_{i-1}^n) \right) + \frac{1}{2} \left( (u_i^{n+1})^2 + (u_i^n)^2 \right) \]

