### Step 2: Implicit Scheme

An implicit scheme for the PDE can be written as follows:

\[ \frac{u_i^{n+1} - u_i^n}{k} = 0.04 \frac{u_{i+1}^{n+1} - 2u_i^{n+1} + u_{i-1}^{n+1}}{h^2} + \frac{1}{2} \left( (u_i^{n+1})^3 + (u_i^n)^3 \right) \]

Rearrange to form a system of linear equations:

\[ \left( 1 - \frac{0.04 k}{h^2} \right) u_i^{n+1} - \frac{0.04 k}{2h^2} (u_{i+1}^{n+1} + u_{i-1}^{n+1}) = \left( 1 + \frac{0.04 k}{h^2} \right) u_i^n + \frac{0.04 k}{2h^2} (u_{i+1}^n + u_{i-1}^n) + \frac{k}{2} \left( (u_i^n)^3 + (u_i^{n+1})^3 \right) \]

