This implementation provides a basic framework for solving the PDE \( u_t = 0.03 u_{xx} + u^3 \) using the finite element method. You can further refine the implementation by optimizing the matrix assembly and time integration steps, or by using more sophisticated basis functions and time-stepping schemes.

