   - Compute the error between solutions obtained with different \( Nx \). For example, calculate the \( L^2 \)-norm of the difference between solutions with \( Nx = 200 \) and \( Nx = 400 \):
     \[
     \text{Error} = \sqrt{\sum_{i=1}^{Nx} (u_{200}(x_i) - u_{400}(x_i))^2 \Delta x}
